  ('Haunted House at Little Amerricka', 'haunted-house', 'haunted', 43.163323, -89.059251, 'Marshall', 'WI', 'This Haunted House is a dark ride inside Little Amerricka Amusement Park in Marshall, not a standalone Halloween haunt. Visitors board a ride vehicle and pass through old-school spooky scenes and effects during the amusement park''s operating season.', 'limited', null, 'https://www.littleamerricka.com/', '2026-09-05T22:12:28.444612+00:00', null, null, null, 'way', 514606719, 'America/Chicago'),
